WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:10.620
Connect your Mac, Linux, Windows, and iPhone with SpecWithCode Connect using one sign-in, a six-character approval code, and same-account machine access.

00:11.300 --> 00:23.940
Open Settings, then Account, and sign in to SpecWithCode Connect. Your machine registers over the encrypted relay and appears online automatically with no IP addresses or VPN setup.

00:24.800 --> 00:39.600
On a second computer with the same Connect account, open Settings, Machines, and Let another of your machines run work here, then pick your main machine. If it is new, approve its code first so Allow unlocks.

00:40.300 --> 00:52.220
Type the one-time six-character code shown on the new device into the approval prompt on the main machine within thirty minutes, then press Allow and confirm to finish with no join line needed.

00:52.800 --> 01:00.400
On your iPhone, sign in to the same Connect account, open Your phone under Machines, and approve the code on each machine.

01:01.300 --> 01:10.020
Main machine on another account or signed out? Link Connect on the worker, then use Join one of your machines and Make a join line.
